{"v":2,"voice":"ziggy-v3","locale":"fr","story":"d21","segments":{"title":{"file":"title.mp3","dur":2.25,"text":"Le paon et le moineau","words":[0.12,0.495,0.82,0.92,1.095],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.295,"grin"],[0.52,"small"],[0.595,"smile"],[0.67,"open"],[0.845,"grin"],[1.12,"small"],[1.195,"o"],[1.27,"open"],[1.37,"grin"],[1.445,"smile"],[1.52,"o"],[1.775,"smile"]]},"s1":{"file":"s1.mp3","dur":28.03,"text":"Dans un grand jardin plein de roses vivait un paon nommé Léopold. Chaque matin, il ouvrait sa queue comme un éventail bleu et vert. « Regardez-moi ! Je suis le plus beau du jardin ! » disait-il. Tout près, sur une branche de lilas, un petit moineau brun gazouillait doucement. Il s’appelait Pipo. Il ne disait rien. Il souriait, simplement.","words":[0.12,0.54,0.715,1.065,1.69,1.94,2.165,2.69,3.165,3.34,3.54,3.84,5.31,5.75,6.525,6.675,7.1,7.325,7.55,7.725,7.825,8.45,8.75,8.9,9.92,9.92,11.7,11.7,12.0,12.15,12.35,12.625,12.825,13.0,14.08,14.08,14.08,15.64,15.94,16.29,16.54,16.715,17.215,17.365,18.24,18.44,18.84,19.29,19.615,20.09,21.51,21.86,22.31,23.5,23.8,23.975,24.4,25.62,26.01,26.585],"visemes":[[0.0,"smile"],[0.24,"grin"],[0.315,"open"],[0.44,"grin"],[0.565,"o"],[0.74,"grin"],[0.915,"open"],[1.09,"grin"],[1.165,"open"],[1.265,"grin"],[1.415,"smile"],[1.49,"grin"],[1.715,"small"],[1.79,"grin"],[2.265,"smile"],[2.365,"o"],[2.515,"grin"],[2.715,"small"],[2.79,"grin"],[2.89,"small"],[3.015,"grin"],[3.19,"o"],[3.365,"small"],[3.465,"open"],[3.565,"grin"],[3.64,"o"],[3.715,"small"],[3.815,"grin"],[4.04,"o"],[4.165,"small"],[4.24,"smile"],[4.365,"o"],[4.515,"grin"],[4.795,"smile"],[5.45,"grin"],[5.55,"open"],[5.65,"grin"],[5.775,"small"],[5.85,"open"],[5.975,"grin"],[6.075,"smile"],[6.15,"grin"],[6.225,"smile"],[6.55,"grin"],[6.7,"o"],[6.8,"small"],[6.875,"grin"],[7.2,"open"],[7.35,"grin"],[7.45,"o"],[7.675,"small"],[7.75,"grin"],[7.9,"small"],[7.975,"open"],[8.05,"smile"],[8.125,"grin"],[8.2,"smile"],[8.275,"open"],[8.35,"grin"],[8.475,"small"],[8.55,"grin"],[8.65